Things were going so[ well,] that[ is] until the element went in the fan oven on Sunday. £50[ later] and it['s] up and running again.
However, things are looking up again[.] Maurice[ rang] me yesterday lunch-time to[ say that] the fishmong[er] had replaced the roe that wasn't very good, free of charge[.] So yesterday evening we dry salted them for 8 hours, and they're in the cold smoker as I speak.
